_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"zlNtAPz4GvSUiljQ-D3cvQ","review_id":"vjQffMjCd_imjmE0l8Dx_Q","date":"2015-03-16T21:27:34","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9354041218757629,"text_excerpt":"Ordered takeout from here while working one weekend. I got a meat-lovers pizza and cheesy bread. I ordered online but It wasn't ready when I walked in, so the bartender chatted me up and gave me a 2-for-1 margarita (which was delicious!!!). She gave me a couple paper plates and some utensils, cheese, and red pepper to go with the pizza and cheesy bread. My order was ready about 10 minutes after I walked in. The pizza was pretty average, as was the cheesy bread. It was in between thin crust and hand-tossed thickness, which was fine by me. I liked it, and the price was pretty good - $20 total (large pizza and bread were enough for three meals). If I want relatively quick pizza while in the ..."},{"business_id":"zlNtAPz4GvSUiljQ-D3cvQ","review_id":"pWPkvQjdwl1802BC155M1A","date":"2014-03-23T19:03:03","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.923463761806488,"text_excerpt":"I cannot believe people are upset about paying $6.99 for a pizza. Really? We found this place on a Sunday when just about everything else in the area was closed except for the chains like Dominos. We were happy to find it, and happy with what we got for the price. Yes, it is a thin crust pizza, and, so, it's going to take a larger pizza to fill you up, but you also taste more of the real flavor of the pizza instead of just the crust. We took advantage of the \"special\" which was two, one-topping large pizzas for $9.99 each with a 2 liter bottle of soda thrown in for no extra charge. I like the flavor and texture of the crust, and the sauce was good. There was no aftertaste in either. The t..."},{"business_id":"zlNtAPz4GvSUiljQ-D3cvQ","review_id":"IWMOEid4MuXgIp6EdOhO9A","date":"2009-11-20T20:15:50","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9166602492332458,"text_excerpt":"Really good pizza in the CBD. From what I saw, the sandwiches and wraps are huge and I'm excited to try them out! And, they deliver! Though I haven't had them deliver to me yet."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"zlNtAPz4GvSUiljQ-D3cvQ","photo_id":"JMwwxARF34aR1aq7hzpiJQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/JMwwxARF34aR1aq7hzpiJQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
